BSIM4 OSDI probe: which module names, parameters and output variables does VACASK's bsim4v8 expose

ground 0

load "bsim4v8.osdi"
load "resistor.osdi"

model resistor resistor
model vsource vsource

v1 (in 0) vsource dc=1
r1 (in 0) resistor r=1k

control
  print device_files
  print device("bsim4")
endc
